{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53680","headline":"王右军宅 · 裴通","name":"王右军宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂金庭洞，清香发桂枝。\n鱼吞左慈钓，鹅踏右军池。\n此地常无事，冲天自有期。\n向来逢道士，多欲驾文螭。\n（见同治九年刊蔡以瑺撰《鄞县志》卷二四）（按：宋高似孙《剡录》卷四及《全唐诗续补遗》卷二十据《永乐大典》卷一三○七四所录，均仅存前四句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴通","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}